# A text file is checked out with LF on every system. Windows' Git converts to CRLF by default, and
# a build from such a checkout is not the one the repository holds: the engine refuses to start its
# agent catalogue because the bytes of the embedded snapshot no longer match their digest.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files, kept byte for byte: no end-of-line conversion and no text diff.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary

